OL,3,AFlavio Bolsonaro calls himself 'leader
OL,4,Aof Brazil' after election loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe defeated candidate in Brazil's
OL,7,Fpresidential election, Flavio
OL,8,FBolsonaro, has referred to himself as
OL,9,F"leader of Brazil" in a letter he
OL,10,Fpublished on social media after leaving
OL,11,Fthe country for the United States.
OL,13,FBolsonaro lost to his left-wing rival,
OL,14,FLuiz Inacio Lula da Silva, in the
OL,15,Frun-off on Sunday by a difference of
OL,16,F4.4 million votes, but has not conceded
OL,17,Fdefeat.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
